emble blends minimalism with youthful energy, ideal for Instagram artistic visuals.  \n\n**Four-Grid Layout Suggestions:**  \n1. **Collarbone Close-up (Black & White Style):** The camera focuses on her shoulders and neck, highlighting the delicate collarbone with naturally cascading hair to guide the viewer’s gaze. The monochrome effect enhances shadows and highlights, emphasizing the sculpted lines while conveying a blend of elegance and cool sophistication.  \n2. **Waistline Shot (Color Style):** A close-up of the contrast between her slender waist and the high-waisted denim skirt. Soft indoor natural lighting highlights the subject, creating a fresh, lifestyle-friendly aesthetic.  \n3. **Lips Close-up (Black & White Style):** Capturing subtle lip details and a faint smile, the monochrome tone adds mystery and sensuality, striking a balance between natural charm and allure.  \n4. **Full-Face & Shoulder Close-up (Color Style):** Soft side lighting illuminates her facial contours and hair details, extending to her shoulders. A delicately blurred background enhances her gentle and refined demeanor.  \n\nThis four-grid composition combines detailed and full-body shots to highlight the character’s unique strengths, fully embracing the premium Instagram aesthetic."], "inputs": [{"shape": 7, "name": "anything", "link": 4940, "label": "anything", "type": "*", "localized_name": "anything"}], "flags": {"collapsed": false}, "id": 670, "type": "easy showAnything", "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfyui-easy-use", "ver": "aedf917067de0dbe28663a59df2b3cadbc46ac99", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "easy showAnything"}, "order": 12}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"shape": 6, "name": "text", "links": [2603], "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "size": [470.49310302734375, 627.8248291015625], "pos": [-3551.19677734375, -1261.41455078125], "widgets_values": ["**角色特征分析：**  \n这名角色展示出优雅与休闲并存的形象特征。她拥有金色的及胸长发，自然垂落，柔顺有光泽，贴合INS风格的氛围。身材纤细有曲线感，腰部线条尤为突出，身体比例协调，给人健康、自信的感觉。穿着搭配简单却极具吸引力：上身为浅色系的紧身短背心，勾勒出肩颈线条及锁骨，下身搭配一条高腰做旧感牛仔短裙，同时将修长的双腿展露无遗。这套穿搭风格将极简与青春活力结合，适合INS艺术照的视觉表达。\n\n**四宫格设计建议：**  \n1. **锁骨特写（黑白风格）：**  \n   镜头聚焦角色的肩颈部位，锁骨线条清晰，搭配发丝自然垂落，形成视觉引导。黑白效果强化阴影和高光，进一步突出立体的身体线条，同时散发出一种高冷与优雅结合的氛围。  \n\n2. **腰线镜头（彩色风格）：**  \n   聚焦腰部与高腰牛仔短裙形成的对比，显现纤细的腰线。背景用柔和的室内自然光突出主体，使照片整体风格清新，增添生活化气息。\n\n3. **嘴唇特写（黑白风格）：**  \n   镜头捕捉她嘴唇的细节，微微勾起嘴角的动态，结合黑白色调体现神秘与性感感，自然又充满吸引力。\n\n4. **完整面部及肩部特写（彩色风格）：**  \n   光线柔和从一侧照射，捕捉面部轮廓及长发的细节，同时延续到肩部。背景虚化得恰到好处，突出温柔与优雅的神采。\n\n这四宫格以细节和整体相结合，展现角色身体每一处的独特优势，同时将INS风的高级感充分释放。"], "inputs": [{"name": "text", "link": 2167, "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "flags": {"collapsed": false}, "id": 724, "type": "ShowText|pysssss", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "ShowText|pysssss"}, "order": 10}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [], "size": [601.8328857421875, 862.9803466796875], "pos": [-1620.471923828125, -1512.416015625], "widgets_values": [], "inputs": [{"name": "images", "link": 4959, "label": "images", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "images"}], "flags": {}, "id": 632, "type": "PreviewImage", "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.3.26", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "PreviewImage"}, "order": 18}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "describe", "links": [2167], "label": "describe", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "describe"}], "size": [400, 200], "pos": [-3524.85009765625, -1532.4063720703125], "widgets_values": ["你是一个经验丰富的编导，分析这张图片的角色特征（包括发型，长相，身材，穿着，尽量详细描述），然后给这个角色，设计一组四宫格的INS风艺术照，每个分镜都突出了她身体的某个部位，比如锁骨、腰线、嘴唇、面部特写，要充满魅力；可以适当增加黑白风格，照片为真人风格，INS风，高品质，不超过500字"], "inputs": [{"name": "ref_image", "link": 1788, "label": "ref_image", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "ref_image"}, {"widget": {"name": "prompt"}, "name": "prompt", "label": "prompt", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "prompt"}], "flags": {}, "id": 721, "type": "RH_Captioner", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "RH_Captioner"}, "order": 8}], "e